  m_Name: Evento_FestivalCultural
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: Festival Cultural
  _titleEn: Cultural Festival
  _category: 1
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Festivais atraem turistas, movimentam o com\xE9rcio e fortalecem a identidade
    da cidade."
  _summaryEn: Festivals attract tourists, boost local business and strengthen the
    city's identity.
  _realWorld: "O Festival Folcl\xF3rico de Parintins, no Amazonas, com a disputa
    entre os bois Garantido e Caprichoso, re\xFAne visitantes de todo o pa\xEDs todo
    ano."
  _realWorldEn: The Parintins Folklore Festival, in Amazonas, with its contest between
    the Garantido and Caprichoso bulls, draws visitors from all over Brazil every
    year.
  _tradeOffs: "Exige seguran\xE7a, limpeza e transporte extras, e a cidade precisa
    dar conta do pico de visitantes."
  _tradeOffsEn: It requires extra security, cleaning and transport, and the city
    must cope with the visitor peak.
  _sources:
  - Label: "Festival Folcl\xF3rico de Parintins (Wikip\xE9dia)"
    Url: https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Festival_Folcl%C3%B3rico_de_Parintins
